[
  {
    "_comment": "优先来源：site:yifan.tv 的查询走这个夹具。必须排在 engine=google 那条之前——那条只看引擎名和片名，会把这个查询也吃掉。",
    "when": [
      "serp.fixture",
      "site:yifan.tv",
      "Night of the Living Dead"
    ],
    "file": "serp-priority-yifan.json"
  },
  {
    "_comment": "顺序即优先级：更具体的匹配必须排在更宽泛的前面，否则会被误匹配。引擎结果排最前——查询串里一旦出现 site:xxx（用户自己配了站点范围时会有），域名子串就会误撞下面那些按域名匹配的条目。",
    "when": [
      "serp.fixture",
      "engine=google",
      "Night of the Living Dead"
    ],
    "file": "serp-google-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "serp.fixture",
      "engine=baidu",
      "Night of the Living Dead"
    ],
    "file": "serp-baidu-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "serp.fixture"
    ],
    "file": "serp-empty.json"
  },
  {
    "_comment": "Jellyfin 自建库。离线演示里指向本地文件，供第五步真解码。",
    "when": [
      "/Items",
      "Night of the Living Dead"
    ],
    "file": "jellyfin-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/metadata/notld_1968_restored_4k"
    ],
    "file": "ia-metadata-notld-restored.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/metadata/notld_behind_the_scenes"
    ],
    "file": "ia-metadata-notld-bts.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/metadata/night_of_the_living_dead"
    ],
    "file": "ia-metadata-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/metadata/metropolis_1927_restored"
    ],
    "file": "ia-metadata-metropolis.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "advancedsearch.php",
      "Night of the Living Dead"
    ],
    "file": "ia-search-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "advancedsearch.php",
      "Metropolis"
    ],
    "file": "ia-search-metropolis.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "advancedsearch.php"
    ],
    "file": "ia-search-empty.json"
  },
  {
    "_comment": "按 /w/api.php 匹配，不要只写域名——引擎查询串里也含这个域名。",
    "when": [
      "commons.wikimedia.org/w/api.php",
      "Metropolis"
    ],
    "file": "commons-search-metropolis.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "commons.wikimedia.org/w/api.php"
    ],
    "file": "commons-search-empty.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/search/multi",
      "Night of the Living Dead"
    ],
    "file": "tmdb-search-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/movie/10331/watch/providers"
    ],
    "file": "tmdb-providers-notld.json"
  },
  {
    "when": [
      "/movie/10331"
    ],
    "file": "tmdb-detail-notld.json"
  }
]
